Buff version manager — install and switch between Buff releases

Usage: buffup <COMMAND>

Commands:
  install  Download and install a Buff version from GitHub Releases
  default  Set the active version by pointing `~/.buff/bin/buff` at the named installed version's binary
  list     List installed versions; the active one is marked with `*`
  update   Self-update buffup (NOT YET IMPLEMENTED — prints guidance)
  help     Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help     Print help
  -V, --version  Print version
